infinite-patch 1
# 3D: a shape seen from any side
node 1 3D Torus Knot
  id knot
  pos 0 318
end
node 2 3D Camera
  id cam
  pos 0 910
  f orbitPerBeat 0.2
end
node 3 3D Light
  id sun
  pos 0 1486
end
node 4 3D Render 3D
  id view
  pos 460 302
end
node 5 Utility Output
  id out
  pos 980 156
end
node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text 3D patches have four parts: a shape, a camera, a light and Render 3D to draw them.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 156
  s text A 3D shape. Try Knot P and Knot Q for different twists, or swap it for a Sphere or Cube.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 8 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 748
  s text The Camera decides the view. Orbit Per Beat makes it circle the shape.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 1340
  s text The Light shades the shape. Try moving its Azimuth.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
node 10 Compositing Comment
  pos 460 156
  s text Render 3D turns shapes, camera and light into a picture.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
geo view 0 knot
geo view camera cam
geo view light_1 sun
cable out 0 view
